determinant of B, do you have to

01:16:11.310 --> 01:16:13.490
confirm that A and B are
squared? Yes, only square

01:16:13.490 --> 01:16:14.890
matrices have a determinant.

01:16:14.890 --> 01:16:15.530
Yes, the

01:16:15.530 --> 01:16:26.650
