01:16:26.650 --> 01:16:28.870
is only a concept for square
matrices.

01:16:28.870 --> 01:16:29.750
Why is that?

01:16:29.750 --> 01:16:32.690
And why is invertibility only a
concept for square matrices?

01:16:32.690 --> 01:16:35.350
Well, remember, in all of these
diagrams,

01:16:35.350 --> 01:16:37.630
where I would visualize the
standard basis vector,

01:16:37.630 --> 01:16:38.170
you know,

01:16:38.170 --> 01:16:40.210
here, the standard basis vectors
before and after the

01:16:40.210 --> 01:16:43.910
transformation, I was drawing
the same Rn in the left and

01:16:43.910 --> 01:16:44.710
right.

01:16:44.710 --> 01:16:47.670
Here I was also drawing the same
