01:18:37.690 --> 01:18:40.730
The column space of x,

01:18:40.730 --> 01:18:45.230
it is a subspace of something.
What is it a subspace of?

01:18:50.890 --> 01:18:51.550
Yeah?

01:18:51.550 --> 01:18:53.310
Is it R d?

