dimensional subspace,

01:20:00.810 --> 01:20:03.430
and y is just some other vector
in R29.

01:20:03.430 --> 01:20:05.350
And the question is, among
everything in this subspace,

01:20:05.350 --> 01:20:06.950
which of them is closest to y,

01:20:06.950 --> 01:20:10.230
given that none of them are
equal to y exactly.

01:20:10.230 --> 01:20:12.550
And what's the answer?

01:20:12.550 --> 01:20:17.050
It's the vector who we'll call
p.

