01:20:30.410 --> 01:20:30.790
Yeah.

01:20:30.790 --> 01:20:32.610
The error vector between y and
p.

01:20:32.610 --> 01:20:35.170
Good.
The error vector between y and p

01:20:35.170 --> 01:20:40.730
